var APPROVED_IMPLEMENTATION_INSTRUCTION = "The Game Blueprint is approved. Unless already in context, read game-workflow.md, the project's gameplay guide and game-delivery.md together in one parallel tool call (adding the game-asset-catalog SKILL.md when the saved production choice uses the catalog), then implement in this existing project, replacing the inherited loading screen first and preserving the brief, saved visual scope and production restrictions. Use game-delivery.md for the requested delivery boundary and minimum sufficient evidence. Do not refresh solely to record local evidence or manually maintain asset provenance.";
